{"title":"Zinc","sourceTitle":"Zinc/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Zinc\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Zinc (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Zinc/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Zinc (54% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Zinc/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Zinc (54% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Zinc/it\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Zinco (2% translated)\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"ltr\">italiano</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Zinc/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Цинк (61% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Zinc/uk\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Цинк (61% translated)\" lang=\"uk\" dir=\"ltr\">українська</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Zinc/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"锌 (61% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Zinc/ja\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"亜鉛 (61% translated)\" lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">日本語</a></li></ul></div>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Lingote de zinco</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ingot-zinc.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/83/Ingot-zinc.png/100px-Ingot-zinc.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/83/Ingot-zinc.png/150px-Ingot-zinc.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/83/Ingot-zinc.png/200px-Ingot-zinc.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Fundível</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ponto de cheiro</b>\n</td>\n<td>419°C\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Requer contêiner</b>\n</td>\n<td>Sim\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saída</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ingot_mold\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ingot mold\">Lingoteira</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Valor de saída</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n<b>Zinco</b> é um metal. Seu principal uso é criar ligas como <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\">bronze de bismuto</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze\" title=\"Bronze\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/brass\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/brass\">latão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Brass\" title=\"Brass\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtendo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtendo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Ligas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ligas</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtendo\">Obtendo</span></h2>\n<p>O minério de zinco é chamado <a href=\"/Sphalerite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sphalerite\">esfalerita</a> e pode ser encontrado em profundidades relativamente rasas. Pepitas de esfalerita não podem ser geradas na superfície. \n</p><p>A textura do zinco é quase invisível em algumas cores de rochas, especialmente no granito. É possível visualizar e até mesmo extrair um bloco de rocha contendo zinco sem perceber a princípio.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Na tabela a seguir, as imagens das “Variantes de textura” foram tiradas em plena luz do sol ao meio-dia. A área à esquerda de cada faixa é de rocha plana, para melhor comparação com a rocha com textura de zinco que se segue.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible\" style=\"width: 75%;\">\n<caption>Zinc ore in host rocha\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Ore-bearing rocha block\n</th>\n<th>Texture variants\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W0@@ Andesite\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W1@@\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W2@@ Basalt\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W3@@\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W4@@ Chalk\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W5@@\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W6@@ Chert\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W7@@\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W8@@ Claystone\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W9@@\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W10@@ Conglomerate\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W11@@\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W12@@ Granite\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W13@@\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W14@@ Limestone\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W15@@\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W16@@ Peridotite\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W17@@\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W18@@ Sandstone\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W19@@\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W20@@ Shale\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W21@@\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W22@@ Slate\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">@@W23@@\n</td></tr></tbody></table></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<dl><dd><table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible\" style=\"width: 75%;\">\n<caption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Zinc ore in host rock</span>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Ore-bearing rock block</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Texture variants</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-andesite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/c4/Ore-sphalerite-andesite.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-andesite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c4/Ore-sphalerite-andesite.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-andesite.png 1.5x, /images/c/c4/Ore-sphalerite-andesite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Andesite</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_andesite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/9/90/Zinc_textures_in_andesite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-basalt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/9f/Ore-sphalerite-basalt.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-basalt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9f/Ore-sphalerite-basalt.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-basalt.png 1.5x, /images/9/9f/Ore-sphalerite-basalt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Basalt</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_basalt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/8/8a/Zinc_textures_in_basalt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-chalk.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/f5/Ore-sphalerite-chalk.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-chalk.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f5/Ore-sphalerite-chalk.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-chalk.png 1.5x, /images/f/f5/Ore-sphalerite-chalk.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Chalk</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_chalk.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/5/56/Zinc_textures_in_chalk.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-chert.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/22/Ore-sphalerite-chert.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-chert.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/22/Ore-sphalerite-chert.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-chert.png 1.5x, /images/2/22/Ore-sphalerite-chert.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Chert</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_chert.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/7/7e/Zinc_textures_in_chert.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-claystone.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/59/Ore-sphalerite-claystone.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-claystone.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/59/Ore-sphalerite-claystone.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-claystone.png 1.5x, /images/5/59/Ore-sphalerite-claystone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Claystone</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_claystone.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/b/b0/Zinc_textures_in_claystone.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-conglomerate.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/1d/Ore-sphalerite-conglomerate.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-conglomerate.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/1d/Ore-sphalerite-conglomerate.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-conglomerate.png 1.5x, /images/1/1d/Ore-sphalerite-conglomerate.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Conglomerate</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_conglomerate.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/2/24/Zinc_textures_in_conglomerate.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-granite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/e6/Ore-sphalerite-granite.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-granite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e6/Ore-sphalerite-granite.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-granite.png 1.5x, /images/e/e6/Ore-sphalerite-granite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Granite</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_granite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/b/b8/Zinc_textures_in_granite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-limestone.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/ec/Ore-sphalerite-limestone.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-limestone.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ec/Ore-sphalerite-limestone.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-limestone.png 1.5x, /images/e/ec/Ore-sphalerite-limestone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Limestone</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_limestone.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/a/a7/Zinc_textures_in_limestone.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-peridotite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/4/41/Ore-sphalerite-peridotite.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-peridotite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/41/Ore-sphalerite-peridotite.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-peridotite.png 1.5x, /images/4/41/Ore-sphalerite-peridotite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Peridotite</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_peridotite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/e/e8/Zinc_textures_in_peridotite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-sandstone.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/17/Ore-sphalerite-sandstone.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-sandstone.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/17/Ore-sphalerite-sandstone.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-sandstone.png 1.5x, /images/1/17/Ore-sphalerite-sandstone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Sandstone</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_sandstone.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/f/fe/Zinc_textures_in_sandstone.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-shale.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/98/Ore-sphalerite-shale.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-shale.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/98/Ore-sphalerite-shale.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-shale.png 1.5x, /images/9/98/Ore-sphalerite-shale.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Shale</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_shale.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/c/cf/Zinc_textures_in_shale.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sphalerite-slate.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/8f/Ore-sphalerite-slate.png/200px-Ore-sphalerite-slate.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/8f/Ore-sphalerite-slate.png/300px-Ore-sphalerite-slate.png 1.5x, /images/8/8f/Ore-sphalerite-slate.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Slate</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Zinc_textures_in_slate.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/5/57/Zinc_textures_in_slate.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"855\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"855\" data-file-height=\"170\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></dd></dl>\n<p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p>Lingotes de zinco puro podem ser forjados em placas de zinco, para uso em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Archimedes_screw\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Archimedes screw\">Parafusos de Arquimedes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Archimedes_screw\" title=\"Archimedes screw\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Alloys\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ligas\">Ligas</span></h3>\n<p>Pepitas de esfalerita podem ser misturadas com vários metais em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/crucible\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/crucible\">cadinho</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Crucible\" title=\"Crucible\"> </a></span> para serem fundidas em lingotes de várias ligas.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<caption>Ligas de zinco\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Liga</th>\n<th>Temperatura de fundição</th>\n<th>Zinco&#160;%</th>\n<th>Outro metal&#160;%</th>\n<th>Outro metal&#160;%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Bronze de bismuto\n</th>\n<td>850°C</td>\n<td>Zinco 20-30%</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Copper\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Copper\">Cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper\" title=\"Copper\"> </a></span> 50-70%</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bismuth\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bismuth\">Bismuto</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bismuth\" title=\"Bismuth\"> </a></span> 10-20%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Latão\n</th>\n<td>920°C</td>\n<td>Zinco 30-40%</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Copper\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Copper\">Cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper\" title=\"Copper\"> </a></span> 60-70%</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Minérios, metais e minerais</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; wi